  - title: LEVEL 8 | Parallel Current Divider | Overview
    explanation: R1 fixed 330 Ohm and R2 replaceable, starting 220 Ohm. Correct R2=470
      Ohm. Each resistor independently spans SwitchOutput to Battery_negative. LCD
      is a high-impedance sense branch, not a return wire.
    caption: PAGE 1/4 | TWO PARALLEL BRANCHES | 5 V EACH
