  - title: LEVEL 8 | Exact Six Wiring Connections
    explanation: 1 SwitchOutput -> R1 Register_Input. 2 SwitchOutput -> R2 Register_Input.
      3 R1 Register_Output -> Battery_negative. 4 R2 Register_Output -> Battery_negative.
      5 LCD_Terminal_A -> SwitchOutput. 6 LCD_Terminal_B -> Battery_negative. Battery+
      to switch input is assumed already wired. Both resistors require their own
      true return path.
    caption: PAGE 2/4 | SIX WIRES AFTER BATTERY+ TO SWITCH INPUT
