  - title: LEVEL 8 | Solution & Four Objectives
    explanation: Replace incorrect R2=220 Ohm with 470 Ohm. Check fixed R1 conducting,
      R1 voltage 4.90-5.10 V, R1 current 14-16 mA, and source current 25-27 mA. Enable
      maximum bounds and require healthy installed resistors. The level evaluator
      decides completion; this authored drawing is not live validation.
    caption: PAGE 4/4 | REPLACE R2 WITH 470 Ohm | TOTAL 25.79 mA
